Hit points are better than what I expected, but armor class and my
speed are definitely inadequate. I pause to think...

   I'm turning around. Heading back up. The Oracle will have to wait.
We'll come back when I feel more confident about my character.

   Heading for the stairs to the Caverns on level 4...

< Ulch - that was tainted. You feel deathly sick. >

